東海郡。春，戊與吳王合謀反，其相張尚、太傅趙夷吾諫，不聽。戊則殺尚、夷吾，起兵與吳西攻梁，破棘壁。至昌邑南，與漢將周亞夫戰。漢絕吳楚糧道，士卒饑，吳王走，楚王戊自殺，軍遂降漢。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m004-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"王戊","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_i5n_lay_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m004-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"薄太后","kind":"person","person_id":"jko_7a4_o8v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m004-0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"戊","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_i5n_lay_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m004-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"hev_8tu_w4k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m004-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"張尚","kind":"person","person_id":"i8p_f0y_kea","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m004-0040","start":40,"end":43,"surface":"趙夷吾","kind":"person","person_id":"d1q_nn7_fvn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m004-0048","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"戊","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_i5n_lay_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m004-0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"尚","kind":"person","person_id":"i8p_f0y_kea","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m004-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"夷吾","kind":"person","person_id":"d1q_nn7_fvn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m004-0076","start":76,"end":79,"surface":"周亞夫","kind":"person","person_id":"e5f_wil_2zp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m004-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"士卒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、泛稱或未定指代；不補未見人物成員與姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m004-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"hev_8tu_w4k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m004-0096","start":96,"end":99,"surface":"楚王戊","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_i5n_lay_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan","book_id":"b-shiji-050","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-050-chuyuan"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:p010","text":"太史公曰：國之將興，必有禎祥，君子用而小人退。國之將亡，賢人隱，亂臣貴。使楚王戊毋刑申公，遵其言，趙任防與先生，豈有篡殺之謀，為天下僇哉？賢人乎，賢人乎！非質有其內，惡能用之哉？甚矣，「安危在出令，存亡在所任」，誠哉是言也！","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m010-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"307_auq_l0i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m010-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"君子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、泛稱或未定指代；不補未見人物成員與姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m010-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"小人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、泛稱或未定指代；不補未見人物成員與姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m010-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"賢人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、泛稱或未定指代；不補未見人物成員與姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m010-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"亂臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、泛稱或未定指代；不補未見人物成員與姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m010-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"楚王戊","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_i5n_lay_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m010-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"申公","kind":"person","person_id":"shn_ixr_kqt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m010-0051","start":51,"end":55,"surface":"防與先生","kind":"person","person_id":"aoj_li6_wuk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m010-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"賢人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、泛稱或未定指代；不補未見人物成員與姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m010-0073","start